<StandardPageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Painting for Beginners handles visitor information, third-party services, cookies, contact messages, and future policy changes." noindex={true}>
  <p><strong>Preview draft — owner/legal review required before public production.</strong> Effective date: not yet approved.</p>
  <h2>Current site behavior</h2>
  <p>The MVP is designed as a static informational website. It does not currently include account registration, comments, advertising scripts, affiliate tracking, newsletter forms, or intentionally configured analytics. Ordinary hosting infrastructure may process technical request data such as IP address, browser information, requested URL, timestamps, and security signals to deliver and protect the site.</p>
  <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
  <p>A public contact channel has not yet been activated. When it is, this policy must be updated to identify the operator, contact processor, purposes, retention practice, and choices available to visitors before messages are collected.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and third parties</h2>
  <p>The current site does not intentionally set advertising or analytics cookies. The policy and consent approach must be reassessed before adding analytics, embedded media, advertising, affiliate tracking, forms, or other third-party services.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The site provides general-audience painting information and is not directed to children under 13. It does not knowingly request personal information from children.</p>
  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>Material changes will be reflected here with an updated effective date. The site operator's legal identity, jurisdiction, public privacy contact, retention details, and any required regional disclosures remain owner/legal signoff items.</p>
</StandardPageLayout>
